<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">WAIT FOR MEEEEEE!!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh no!\nI overslept and blew my chance\fto be the first one in!\rStupid, stupid me...\nI set FOUR alarms!\fSob... sob...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stupid, stupid me...\nFour alarms. FOUR.\fSob... sob...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Click, click, click...\nOh! It’s you!\rI’m over bein’ first.\rNow I count how many people come\nto the Battle Frontier.\fAin’t nobody ask me to.\fIt’s a hobby. Don’t judge.\fYou number 4,812. Congrats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I can’t stop shakin’!\rI told my whole fam I’d run the\nBattle Frontier when I left home...\fMy grandma made a banner.\rWhat I’mma do if I get beat\nto a pulp?!\rShe already bought the frame!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...You look real young.\r...\n...\rIf YOU here, I can do this.\nI’mma challenge the Battle Frontier...\fMaybe!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’mma pull myself together and\nchallenge the Battle Frontier!\r...\nOr I might go home. It’s lookin’ 50/50.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Finally!\nI’m at the Battle Frontier!\rWhen scraps on the road stop hittin’,\nyou gotta come here.\fAin’t that right? Say it’s right.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Normally you just pick homies and\nscrap.\rBut switch up the rules or the\nlimits and suddenly the scrap get\fway more fun.\rThe spot where you get that fun...\nis the Battle Frontier!\fThey payin’ me to say this.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0104_D32R0102_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the Battle Frontier\rPull Up, Proud Hustlers\nAim for the Top!</language>
	</row>
</body>
